msgid "Couldn’t refresh release notes. Please try again."
msgstr "Tidak dapat menyegarkan catatan rilis. Silakan coba lagi."

msgid "Does a submission mean my post is published?"
msgstr "Apakah kiriman berarti postingan saya dipublikasikan?"

msgid "Does my computer need to stay on?"
msgstr "Apakah komputer saya harus tetap menyala?"

