msgstr "Bawaan sistem"

msgid "System default ({0})"
msgstr "Bawaan sistem ({0})"

msgid "System packages may ask for administrator authorization."
msgstr "Paket sistem mungkin meminta otorisasi administrator."

msgid "Unsigned installer: Windows may show a SmartScreen warning. The portable version needs no installation; account data stays in the app data folder."
msgstr "Penginstal yang tidak ditandatangani: Windows mungkin menampilkan peringatan SmartScreen. Versi portabel tidak memerlukan instalasi; data akun tetap berada di folder data aplikasi."

